{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 21,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 357.864,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Ammon and his brethren separated themselves in the borders of the land of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "21:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.914,
      "end": 12.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold Aaron took his journey towards the land which was called by the Lamanites, Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "21:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 13.131,
      "end": 16.521,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "calling it after the land of their fathers' nativity;",
      "verse": "21:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 16.701,
      "end": 19.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was away joining the borders of Mormon.",
      "verse": "21:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 20.307,
      "end": 27.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Lamanites and the Amalekites and the people of Amulon had built a great city, which was called Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "21:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 28.603,
      "end": 31.9,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Lamanites of themselves were sufficiently hardened,",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 32.08,
      "end": 35.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the Amalekites and the Amulonites were still harder;",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 35.789,
      "end": 40.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they did cause the Lamanites that they should harden their hearts,",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 40.892,
      "end": 45.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should wax strong in wickedness and their abominations.",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 46.123,
      "end": 49.652,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Aaron came to the city of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "21:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 49.832,
      "end": 52.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and first began to preach to the Amalekites.",
      "verse": "21:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 52.52,
      "end": 55.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he began to preach to them in their synagogues,",
      "verse": "21:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 55.719,
      "end": 59.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had built synagogues after the order of the Nehors;",
      "verse": "21:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 59.382,
      "end": 64.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for many of the Amalekites and the Amulonites were after the order of the Nehors.",
      "verse": "21:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 64.752,
      "end": 70.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, as Aaron entered into one of their synagogues to preach unto the people,",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 70.412,
      "end": 72.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as he was speaking unto them,",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 72.635,
      "end": 77.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold there arose an Amalekite and began to contend with him, saying:",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 77.598,
      "end": 79.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What is that thou hast testified?",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 79.821,
      "end": 81.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Hast thou seen an angel?",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 81.626,
      "end": 83.809,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why do not angels appear unto us?",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 83.989,
      "end": 86.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold are not this people as good as thy people?",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 87.548,
      "end": 89.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou also sayest,",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 89.307,
      "end": 91.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except we repent we shall perish.",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 91.948,
      "end": 95.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How knowest thou the thought and intent of our hearts?",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 95.472,
      "end": 97.887,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How knowest thou that we have cause to repent?",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 98.067,
      "end": 101.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How knowest thou that we are not a righteous people?",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 101.591,
      "end": 103.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we have built sanctuaries,",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 107.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we do assemble ourselves together to worship God.",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 107.431,
      "end": 109.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We do believe that God will save all men.",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 110.479,
      "end": 112.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Aaron said unto him:",
      "verse": "21:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 112.377,
      "end": 116.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou that the Son of God shall come to redeem mankind from their sins?",
      "verse": "21:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 117.515,
      "end": 119.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the man said unto him:",
      "verse": "21:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 119.32,
      "end": 122.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We do not believe that thou knowest any such thing.",
      "verse": "21:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 122.658,
      "end": 125.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We do not believe in these foolish traditions.",
      "verse": "21:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 125.532,
      "end": 128.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We do not believe that thou knowest of things to come,",
      "verse": "21:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 128.777,
      "end": 138.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither do we believe that thy fathers and also that our fathers did know concerning the things which they spake, of that which is to come.",
      "verse": "21:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 139.163,
      "end": 142.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Aaron began to open the scriptures unto them",
      "verse": "21:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 142.872,
      "end": 148.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the coming of Christ, and also concerning the resurrection of the dead,",
      "verse": "21:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 148.393,
      "end": 151.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that there could be no redemption for mankind",
      "verse": "21:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 151.638,
      "end": 157.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were through the death and sufferings of Christ, and the atonement of his blood.",
      "verse": "21:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 158.448,
      "end": 163.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass as he began to expound these things unto them",
      "verse": "21:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 163.226,
      "end": 166.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were angry with him, and began to mock him;",
      "verse": "21:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 166.425,
      "end": 169.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they would not hear the words which he spake.",
      "verse": "21:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 170.17,
      "end": 173.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, when he saw that they would not hear his words,",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 173.461,
      "end": 176.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he departed out of their synagogue,",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 176.288,
      "end": 179.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and came over to a village which was called Ani-Anti,",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 180.09,
      "end": 186.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there he found Muloki preaching the word unto them; and also Ammah and his brethren.",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 186.307,
      "end": 188.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they contended with many about the word.",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 189.355,
      "end": 194.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they saw that the people would harden their hearts,",
      "verse": "21:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 194.458,
      "end": 198.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they departed and came over into the land of Middoni.",
      "verse": "21:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 198.307,
      "end": 200.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did preach the word unto many,",
      "verse": "21:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 200.948,
      "end": 204.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and few believed on the words which they taught.",
      "verse": "21:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 204.739,
      "end": 209.708,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, Aaron and a certain number of his brethren were taken and cast into prison,",
      "verse": "21:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 209.888,
      "end": 214.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the remainder of them fled out of the land of Middoni unto the regions round about.",
      "verse": "21:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 215.63,
      "end": 218.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And those who were cast into prison suffered many things,",
      "verse": "21:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 219.014,
      "end": 222.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were delivered by the hand of Lamoni and Ammon,",
      "verse": "21:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 222.677,
      "end": 224.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were fed and clothed.",
      "verse": "21:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 225.633,
      "end": 228.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they went forth again to declare the word,",
      "verse": "21:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 228.599,
      "end": 233.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they were delivered for the first time out of prison;",
      "verse": "21:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 233.516,
      "end": 235.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they had suffered.",
      "verse": "21:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 236.146,
      "end": 240.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they went forth whithersoever they were led by the Spirit of the Lord,",
      "verse": "21:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 241.063,
      "end": 244.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "preaching the word of God in every synagogue of the Amalekites,",
      "verse": "21:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 245.144,
      "end": 249.509,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or in every assembly of the Lamanites where they could be admitted.",
      "verse": "21:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 250.189,
      "end": 253.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord began to bless them,",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 253.573,
      "end": 258.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that they brought many to the knowledge of the truth;",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 258.769,
      "end": 264.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they did convince many of their sins, and of the traditions of their fathers, which were not correct.",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 265.533,
      "end": 274.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Ammon and Lamoni returned from the land of Middoni to the land of Ishmael, which was the land of their inheritance.",
      "verse": "21:18",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 275.269,
      "end": 280.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And king Lamoni would not suffer that Ammon should serve him, or be his servant.",
      "verse": "21:19",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 280.918,
      "end": 286.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But he caused that there should be synagogues built in the land of Ishmael;",
      "verse": "21:20",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 286.299,
      "end": 292.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he caused that his people, or the people who were under his reign, should assemble themselves together.",
      "verse": "21:20",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 293.156,
      "end": 295.246,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did rejoice over them,",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 295.426,
      "end": 297.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did teach them many things.",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 297.742,
      "end": 302.2,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did also declare unto them that they were a people who were under him,",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 302.38,
      "end": 304.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they were a free people,",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 305.068,
      "end": 310.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they were free from the oppressions of the king, his father;",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 310.542,
      "end": 321.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for that his father had granted unto him that he might reign over the people who were in the land of Ishmael, and in all the land round about.",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 321.717,
      "end": 329.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also declared unto them that they might have the liberty of worshiping the Lord their God according to their desires,",
      "verse": "21:22",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 329.931,
      "end": 332.16,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in whatsoever place they were in,",
      "verse": "21:22",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 332.34,
      "end": 336.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if it were in the land which was under the reign of king Lamoni.",
      "verse": "21:22",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 337.339,
      "end": 340.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon did preach unto the people of king Lamoni;",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 340.677,
      "end": 347.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it came to pass that he did teach them all things concerning things pertaining to righteousness.",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 347.73,
      "end": 351.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did exhort them daily, with all diligence;",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 351.3,
      "end": 353.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they gave heed unto his word,",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 353.802,
      "end": 357.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were zealous for keeping the commandments of God.",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 85
    }
  ]
}